{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "The World of Work", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Starting a Company", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 1, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 3, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B2.1", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": " Identify and describe issues relating to money, in written and spoken situations according to work and social contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": " Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": " Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": " Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "The Simple Past and The Past Continuous Tenses", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you talk about events in your life, it is common to use a mixture of tenses. This allows you to convey a variety of timelines and action sequences.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You use the <span class=\"strong\">Simple Past tense</span> to talk about past events of different kinds. It can be: short actions that finished quickly, repeated events or events of a longer duration in the past.<br><span class=\"italic\"><ul><li>I <span class=\"strong\">did </span> a lot of work.</li><li>They<span class=\"strong\"> hired</span>  me right away.</li><li>I <span class=\"strong\">needed </span> to find a quick fix to the problem.</li></ul></span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You use the <span class=\"strong\">Past Continuous tense </span>to talk about an event that was happening at a time before now.<br><span class=\"italic\"><ul><li>I <span class=\"strong\">was interviewing</span> in the city. </li><li>I <span class=\"strong\">was getting</span> anxious.</li><li> I <span class=\"strong\">was starting</span> to get frustrated. </li></ul></span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Simple Past\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Past Continuous \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"new event\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"event that is already in progress \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"events happened after one another\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"events happened at the same time\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"just mentioning an event\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"emphasizing the progress of an event\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Asking for and Giving Information ", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you want to learn more about a company, you can talk to a professional to get more information. The kinds of questions you ask the professional will serve as clues for them to know what kind of information and/or answer you are looking for. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You can ask for: <ul><li>background information</li> <li>reasons</li> <li>examples</li> <li>ideas</li> <li>suggestions</li> <li>opinions</li></ul> <br/><br/>Remember that when asking for information you can use <span class=\"strong\">Wh- words. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Question Word\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Use\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Who\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"used to ask for a suggestion or an opinion about someone\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">What\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"used to ask for background information, examples or ideas\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">When\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"used to ask for examples\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Why\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" used to ask for reasons\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">How\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"used to ask for a variety of things\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "What were the biggest challenges?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "How did you get your start in the industry?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "When did you realize you wanted to start your company?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "How do you feel about that?", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "start-up company", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a new small business ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You mentioned that you started Polygon as a start-up company.  ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le03ob01aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use when giving information about a company.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "non-profit work ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "work where the money earned is used to help people instead of making a profit ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I began working in non-profit work when I was younger.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le03ob01aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to gravitate toward(s)", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to be interested in something and become involved with it ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I just enjoyed what I was doing, and it was always what I gravitated toward.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le03ob01aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "monetary ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "relating to money ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The referrals moved me away from B2B where the monetary business is.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le03ob01aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "capital", "type": "name"}, {"content": "money used to start a business or to produce more wealth", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: I realized early on that I needed to raise capital.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le03ob01aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "entrepreneur ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "someone who starts a new business ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Why did you want to strike out on your own and become an entrepreneur?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le03ob01aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "niche", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a job or activity that is very suitable for you", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: Have you got your niche covered?  ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le03ob01aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn9le03ob01re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Do you know of any entrepreneurs? If not, research one.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "While you do your research note some information on the entrepreneur, then think of 10 questions to ask them.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Once you have your 10 questions, think of a possible answer for each one.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "If possible, talk to the actual person or send them an e-mail with your questions.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I identify an entrepreneur.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write questions appropriate to ask an entrepreneur.  ", "type": "tex